=== Text #11 ===
> We offer both RTMP (real time media protocol) and Progressive HTTP streaming for Flash or MP4 video so whether you want the flexibility of a Flash Application server or[ universally] accessible HTTP streaming we can handle it.
We can handle on demand or live r[tmp]/http flash streaming and our network is[ scalable] to extremely high volumes.
For on demand streaming we utilise our FLV/MP4 hosting cluster, for live streaming we run Wowza Media Professional servers.
We can offer[ scalable] handling of traffic across multiple servers within our platform. Using traditional round[ rob]in DNS clusters or modern origin/[edge] server configurations, we can ensure that no matter how popular your stream[ becomes] we can handle the load. Our clustering solutions are similar to those used by YouTube.
Live, low[ latency] live flash conf[eren]cing.

